  <body>
    <front><contents /></front>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOFastaReader class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOFastaReader" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOFastaReader.h</declared>
        <desc>
          <p>
            <em>Inherits From:</em> NSObject
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>Conforms To:</em> NSObject (NSObject)
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>Declared In:</em> Import/TTIOFastaReader.h
          </p>
          <p>
            FASTA importer. Parses a FASTA file into either a
            <code>TTIOReferenceImport</code> (reference-genome
            embedding) or an unaligned
            <code>TTIOWrittenGenomicRun</code> (panels, target
            lists, quality-stripped reads).
          </p>
          <p>
            gzip-compressed input is auto-detected via
            the <code>1f 8b</code> magic bytes regardless of file
            extension.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>API status:</strong> Provisional.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Cross-language equivalents:</strong>
            <br /> Python:
            <code>ttio.importers.fasta.FastaReader</code> <br />
            Java:
            <code>
              global.thalion.ttio.importers.FastaReader
            </code>
          </p>
        </desc>
        <method type="TTIOReferenceImport*" factory="yes">
          <sel>readReferenceFromPath:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">path</arg>
          <sel>uri:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">uri</arg>
          <sel>error:</sel>
          <arg type="NSError**">error</arg>
          <desc>
            Parse the file as a reference genome. @param
            <var>path</var> FASTA file <var>path</var>. @param
            <var>uri</var> Reference URI, or <code>nil</code> to
            derive from the filename stem. @param
            <var>error</var> Out-parameter populated on failure.
            @return <code>TTIOReferenceImport</code> on
            success, or <code>nil</code> on failure.
          </desc>
        </method>
        <method type="TTIOWrittenGenomicRun*" factory="yes">
          <sel>readUnalignedFromPath:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">path</arg>
          <sel>sampleName:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">sampleName</arg>
          <sel>platform:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">platform</arg>
          <sel>referenceUri:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">referenceUri</arg>
          <sel>acquisitionMode:</sel>
          <arg type="TTIOAcquisitionMode">acquisitionMode</arg>
          <sel>error:</sel>
          <arg type="NSError**">error</arg>
          <desc>
            Parse the file as a set of unaligned reads. @param
            <var>path</var> FASTA file <var>path</var>. @param
            <var>sampleName</var> Sample tag for the run. @param
            <var>platform</var> Platform tag. @param
            <var>referenceUri</var> Reference URI to record on
            the run. @param <var>acquisitionMode</var> Run-level
            acquisition mode. @param <var>error</var>
            Out-parameter populated on failure. @return
            <code>TTIOWrittenGenomicRun</code> on success, or
            <code>nil</code> on failure.
          </desc>
        </method>
        <method type="TTIOWrittenGenomicRun*" factory="yes">
          <sel>readUnalignedFromPath:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">path</arg>
          <sel>sampleName:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">sampleName</arg>
          <sel>platform:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">platform</arg>
          <sel>referenceUri:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">referenceUri</arg>
          <sel>acquisitionMode:</sel>
          <arg type="TTIOAcquisitionMode">acquisitionMode</arg>
          <sel>progress:</sel>
          <arg type="TTIOProgressBlock">progress</arg>
          <sel>error:</sel>
          <arg type="NSError**">error</arg>
          <desc>
            Progress-aware overload of {@link
            readUnalignedFromPath:sampleName:platform:referenceUri:acquisitionMode:error:}. Fires {@code progress(readsDone, -1)} every {@link TTIOFastaReaderProgressIntervalReads} records during the parse phase, and a final {@code progress(total, total)} once the record count is known. Pass {@code <code>nil</code>} for {@code <var>progress</var>} to skip all callbacks; existing callers are unaffected. @param <var>progress</var> Optional <var>progress</var> block. {@code <code>nil</code>} = no callbacks.
          </desc>
        </method>
      </class>
    </chapter>
